-- ModConfigMenu (if installed) shows them in the game's Settings window, writes the ini and bumps the
-- plugin's change counter; the script polls that counter and reads the ini again.
-- Generated by gen_mcm.py from mcm/spec.py and lang/*.txt, like the MCM page; edit those instead.

